# Bare /squads MUST precede /squads/* — a Cloudflare _headers `/squads/*` rule
# does NOT match the bare path, so without this line /squads returned 200 with
# NO X-Robots-Tag (SKILL §AD). Keep this rule if /squads is ever unblocked in
# robots.txt, otherwise it would become indexable.
/squads
